      "answer": {
        "response": "This query finds the target file auto_ontology/dal/session.py, then joins imports to the importing files. It keeps only importers whose files.is_test flag is true and returns each distinct test file_id once. The assumption is that file_id stores the repository-relative path and imported_file_id identifies the resolved internal target file.",
        "sql_code": "WITH target AS (\n  SELECT file_id\n  FROM code.files\n  WHERE file_id = 'auto_ontology/dal/session.py'\n)\nSELECT DISTINCT f.file_id\nFROM code.imports i\nJOIN code.files f ON f.file_id = i.file_id\nJOIN target t ON t.file_id = i.imported_file_id\nWHERE f.is_test\nORDER BY f.file_id",
